        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/demiher0/{size}/1931_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-04-22T06:23:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes. I enjoy watching the light drain from my friends eyes as a full to very low health coolant blast goes off. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=9\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\"></p>\n<p>Also really enjoyed this ep. Told a nice slightly different story from what we know and allowed C&amp;A to story tell again which I quite enjoy.</p>",
