        "created_at": "2018-04-23T18:50:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It’s not that bad - when you have Thermal Shockwave in play, just put the health tokens for all the cold damage you deal on the Shockwave card instead of returning them to the supply. When you have Coolant Blast in play,  and Absolute Zero takes fire damage, move his HP tokens onto the Blast card.</p>",
